```plantuml
@startuml US074_SSD
title US074 - Deactivate Flight Route - SSD

actor "ATCC" as Collab
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Collab -> System : request to deactivate flight route
System --> Collab : show list of active routes

Collab -> System : select route
System --> Collab : request deactivation date

Collab -> System : input deactivation date (yyyy-MM-dd)
alt date is in the past
    System --> Collab : show error (date cannot be in the past)
else planned flights exist after date
    System --> Collab : show error (planned flights exist, impossible to deactivate)
else valid date
    System --> Collab : ask for confirmation
end

Collab -> System : confirm deactivation
System --> Collab : success message
@enduml